  "contentHtml": "<p>라일락, 콩나물 너무 좋네요... 채소가 관찰하기 좋은 것 같아요...전... 마늘쫑, 봉선화, 목련잎 추천합니다~~ <br>슈퍼에 파는 마늘쫑, 봉선화(학교) 하루동안 잉크에 담궈서 현미경관찰했는데 잘나와요~ 기공은 목련 잎(학교) 추천하구요~~</p><p>구하기 쉽고 잘 나오는 거 정보 공유하면 좋을 거 같아요.. 아이들이 조별로 태블릿으로 찍은 거예요</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/23364E3C55F264B129\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"740\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"마늘쫑줄기.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"740\"  id=\"A_23364E3C55F264B129E409\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/23463D3C55F264B11B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"740\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"마늘쫑줄기2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"740\"  id=\"A_23463D3C55F264B11B54EC\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2544463C55F264B21D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"740\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"목력잎.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"740\"  id=\"A_2544463C55F264B21D4A70\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/214B4F3C55F264B217\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"740\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"봉선화.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"740\"  id=\"A_214B4F3C55F264B2176030\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21368E3C55F264B328\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"740\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"봉선화2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"740\"  id=\"A_21368E3C55F264B3283FEE\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
